{{DISPLAYTITLE:Fishing Guide}}
__TOC__

Fishing is rod-gated and is one of the main economy loops.

== Basics ==
* You must own and equip a rod
* Fishing cooldown: '''15 minutes'''
* Sell single catch, last catch, or all unsold catches

== Rod Tiers ==
{| class="wikitable"
! Rod !! Cost !! Trash Weight Multiplier !! Sell Bonus !! Double Sell Chance !! Rarity Bump Chance
|-
| Starter Rod || 300 || x1.00 || x1.00 || 0% || 0%
|-
| Improved Rod || 2000 || x0.80 || x1.08 || 0% || 3%
|-
| Elite Rod || 7500 || x0.65 || x1.12 || 6% || 7%
|}

== Commands ==
* <code>/rod shop</code>
* <code>/rod buy tier:&lt;starter|improved|elite&gt;</code>
* <code>/rod equip tier:&lt;starter|improved|elite&gt;</code>
* <code>/fish cast</code>
* <code>/fish sell catch_id:&lt;id|last|all&gt;</code>
* <code>/fish collection</code>
* <code>/fish rarities</code>
* <code>/fish index</code>

